-- #1114: the DECLARED-context half of the same matrix.  `lib/obl1114_declared.mdk`
-- WRITES `g : Num a => a -> a`, and the selective spelling of this already rejected at
-- check before #1114 — but the wildcard spelling did NOT (measured: `check` exit 0,
-- `run` "type error in ..., Run `medaka check` for details", i.e. run reporting a type
-- error check declines to print).  So the spelling axis was broken independently of the
-- declared/inferred axis, and both cells are the same §4.2 D6 violation.
import lib.obl1114_declared.*

main = println (g "abc")
